-other-beast","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aetherdrift-like-no-other-beast#:~:text=I%27m%20druid%2Dtrained%2C%20if%20your,had%20thought%20to%20ask.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Aetherdrift | Like No Other Beast\" by Zachary Olson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Jan 2025."}},{"id":"aetherdrift-like-no-other-beast-e26","era":null,"summary":"Nathala shows she took the fire amulet, which is the vehicle's ignition key.","participants":["nathala","fire-amulet","endriders","grazak"],"location":"the-tarry-spire","importance":"major","page":"stories/aetherdrift-like-no-other-beast","order":938,"story_date":"2025-01-16","storyline":"Aetherdrift","source":"wizards","paragraph":120,"quote":"The racers—Endriders, they call themselves—called it an ignition key.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aetherdrift-like-no-other-beast#:~:text=The%20racers%E2%80%94Endriders%2C%20they%20call,it%20an%20ignition%20key.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Aetherdrift | Like No Other Beast","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Zachary Olson"],"date":"2025-01-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aetherdrift-like-no-other-beast","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aetherdrift-like-no-other-beast#:~:text=The%20racers%E2%80%94Endriders%2C%20they%20call,it%20an%20ignition%20key.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Aetherdrift | Like No Other Beast\" by Zachary Olson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Jan 2025."}},{"id":"aetherdrift-like-no-other-beast-e27","era":null,"summary":"Nathala declares the vehicle hers to take and study for her people.","participants":["nathala","the-vehicle"],"location":"the-tarry-spire","importance":"minor","page":"stories/aetherdrift-like-no-other-beast","order":938,"story_date":"2025-01-16","storyline":"Aetherdrift","source":"wizards","paragraph":122,"quote":"The vehicle is mine to take.","link":"https://m